OL,3,GNEWSAValuable bust 'found in shed'
OL,4,Acould still be sold overseas, says
OL,5,Acouncil
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn 18th Century sculpture valued at
OL,8,Fmore than #3m could be sold to an
OL,9,Foverseas buyer if a museum fails to
OL,10,Fraise the funds to buy it.
OL,12,FThe bust of Highland landowner and MP
OL,13,FSir John Gordon was made by Edme
OL,14,FBouchardon, whose other works have been
OL,15,Fexhibited in the Louvre in Paris and J
OL,16,FPaul Getty Museum in Los Angeles.
OL,18,FIt lay forgotten in local authority
OL,19,Fstorage for years - and was claimed to
OL,20,Fhave been found propping open the door
OL,21,Fof a garden shed - before it was put up
OL,22,Ffor sale by Highland Council.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
