OL,3,GNEWSAValuable bust 'found in shed'
OL,4,Acould still be sold overseas, says
OL,5,Acouncil
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvergordon Naval Museum and Heritage
OL,8,FCentre wants to buy the artwork, but a
OL,9,Fnew report said if it did not have
OL,10,Ffunds needed by 1 December the council
OL,11,Fcould proceed with a sale to an
OL,12,Foverseas buyer.
